                        <span style="font-size: 13px;">✓</span>I have read and accept this agreement</button>
                        <button id="skipfrlater" style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; padding: 11px 20px; border: 1.5px solid rgb(208, 213, 221); border-radius: 6px; background-color: rgb(249, 250, 251); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); cursor: pointer;"><span style="font-size: 13px;">—</span>Skip — I'll review later</button>
                    </div>
                    <p id="dispwarning" style="display:none; font-size: 13px; color: rgb(138, 88, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 251, 240); border: 1px solid rgb(240, 208, 128); border-radius: 6px; padding: 10px 14px; margin-top: 12px;">Note: Skipping this agreement will be recorded. Your instructor may follow up before accepting your submission.</p>
